-patel-email-hacks-handala-00848519'>FBI confirms hackers targeted Director Kash Patel’s personal emails</a> - politico.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cvgl4yk7vgpo'>Iran-backed hackers breach FBI director Kash Patel&#x27;s personal emails</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/03/27/pro-iran-group-claims-credit-for-hack-of-fbi-director-kash-patels-personal-email-account'>Pro-Iran group claims credit for hack of FBI Director Kash Patel&#x27;s personal email account</a> - euronews.com</li></ul>